11585 0 obj
<</Producer()/ModDate(D:20230918183608-05'00')/CreationDate(D:20230918175451-04'00')/Author(Philostratus; F. C. Conybeare, translator)/Creator()/Title(Philostratus, The Life of Apollonius of Tyana)/Subject(Life of an early Greek mystic)/Keywords(History, Historical, Rome, Roman, Roman Empire, Late Antiquity, Philosophers, Mystics, Apollonius, Philostratus, Literature, Biography, Encomium, Mysticism\r\n\r\nPhilostratus, The Life of Apollonius of Tyana, translated from Greek to English by F. C. Conybeare \(New York, 1912\). The download contains both volumes of the Loeb Library series \(L16N and L17N\) in 1252 bookmarked and searchable pdf pages, which also contains the Epistles of Apollonius and Eusebius' criticism of the Life.  Attached to the document is a multilingual HTML version of the Life. Wikipedia has a main entry \(Apollonius\), and a group of related entries about the 1st-century Greek philosopher, miracle-worker, and religious teacher. Books digitized by Google and compiled by Robert Bedrosian.)>>
endobj
